  m_Name: Fenris
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Rarety: 0
  m_Description: "Leader of the Lunacians, he stands as the alpha of a pack of wolves
    that roams the frozen lands.\nSince he rose to power a century ago\u2014by murdering
    any other alpha who dared stand in his way\u2014his rule has never been put in
    jeopardy.\nHe is the embodiment of Lunacian wild and untamed brutality, a force
    of nature that no other Lunacian would dare challenge.\nUnder his rule, the frozen
    lands are both his hunting ground and his kingdom."
  m_SpellElements: 
  m_AutoAttack: IceClaws
  m_SpecialAbility: AlphaHowling
  m_Ultimate: PackHunt
